{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"סוֹגֵר "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965 rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/efchad_bemaasai","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n283.jpg","n":"132"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"דֶּלֶת. בְּעַד תְּמִימִים בְּזַעַם. עַד בֹּא קִצָּם. צֵאת לְזִכָּרוֹן: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
